  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BasisBank Sustainability Bond Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">$15 million OCR investment in a senior unsecured sustainable bond tranche issued by BB to ADB. BB will also issue a parallel sustainable tranche to be subscribed by local investors. 50% of the sustainability bond proceeds will be used for climate-friendly investments and 50% for social investments, following the NBG&amp;apos;s SFT.</narrative>
  </description>
